1948-                  <tr data-shape-index="2" data-shape-ref="D37" data-excel-book="0505" data-excel-sheet="スマレジ受信処理" data-excel-ref="0505:スマレジ受信処理!D37"><td class="shape-ref">D37</td><td>ECCUBE</td></tr>
1949:                  <tr data-shape-index="3" data-shape-ref="D37" data-excel-book="0505" data-excel-sheet="スマレジ受信処理" data-excel-ref="0505:スマレジ受信処理!D37"><td class="shape-ref">D37</td><td>A. ★スマレジ取引IDを送信</td></tr>
1950:                  <tr data-shape-index="4" data-shape-ref="D37" data-excel-book="0505" data-excel-sheet="スマレジ受信処理" data-excel-ref="0505:スマレジ受信処理!D37"><td class="shape-ref">D37</td><td>B. ★スマレジ取引IDで取引詳細を要求</td></tr>
